    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operation errors",
      "description": "Server spans per second that ended in error status, by service and span name. A 4xx response is not a span error; a 5xx response or a failed gRPC call is. Empty until a server span with error status is recorded; verify Operation rate to check ingestion.",
